OL,3,ANigeria's first Ebola patient holidayed
OL,4,Ain Uganda, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's first confirmed case of Ebola
OL,7,Fsince the outbreak in East Africa began
OL,8,Fin May is the wife of a diplomat who
OL,9,Ftravelled to Uganda's capital for a
OL,10,Fholiday, the head of Africa's health
OL,11,Fagency has told the BBC.
OL,13,FThe woman is originally from Uganda but
OL,14,Fbased in Abuja, where she fell ill
OL,15,Fthree days after arriving home in the
OL,16,FNigerian capital on 3 October,
OL,17,Faccording to Dr Jean Kaseya from the
OL,18,FAfrica Centres for Disease Control and
OL,19,FPrevention.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
