OL,3,ANigeria's first Ebola patient holidayed
OL,4,Ain Uganda, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's health minister has confirmed
OL,7,Fto the BBC the 42-year-old patient
OL,8,Fspent two and a half weeks in Kampala,
OL,9,Fadding that she also made a two-hour
OL,10,Fstopover in Ethiopia's capital on her
OL,11,Freturn.
OL,13,F"She's stable, she's improving,"
OL,14,FMuhammad Ali Pate said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
